;    8: TDecorate(count=27, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ふ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=さ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=きりばこ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=はいかい, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=13464750, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=つな, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   14: TDecorate(count=5, unk2=16777215, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   15: TDecorate(count=6, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   16: TDecorate(count=10, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   17: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=なら, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=7318, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=6675, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\和ぴあの２.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>This case is far more complex and baffling than I expected, and it overturns common sense.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even someone who would normally be worth trusting has to be approached with doubt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes―right now, I harbor no small doubt about this <STYLE ID="1">Erika Niimura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not distrust so much as doubt.<PG>
For the head who rules this settlement, she knows far too little about this case.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The lore <STYLE ID="1">this person</STYLE> passed on to me is certainly valuable information.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it is merely something handed down across generations, not information specific to these curse-killings or to <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.<PG>
Conversely, her son <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> seems to have gained a certain amount of knowledge from the books in the storehouse, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The relationship between <STYLE ID="1">this person</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> somehow doesn't add up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No doubt they're mother and son, but the difference in what they know is far too great.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\荒田枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
No, that isn't necessarily the case.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I compare this mother and son, the gap in what they know about the curse-killings is glaring, just as I reasoned a moment ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then what if I compare the two of them with the people of the settlement?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suppose, for instance, that it isn't <STYLE ID="1">Obaasan's</STYLE> knowledge that is lacking, but <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san's</STYLE> that stands out far too much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so, that changes things.<PG>
I can understand <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> poring over the books in the storehouse to cure <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> madness 10 years ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That much I can understand, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
What is this feeling that something's off?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something's wrong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't see it... I, of all people, can't see it...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means maybe I'm overthinking this after all...<PG>
No, there's something crucial I still don't know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or rather, there's something nobody has asked yet.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Um, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, there's something I'd like to ask."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> madness ten years ago―how was it cured?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If I remember right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">they gave falsificaso to </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Do you know about the green-eye curse-killing?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yes. Girls born with green eyes feel murderous intent toward people with precognition..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's right. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was looking into all sorts of things to cure it, and he came across a drug that cures those infected with Droga."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"But why give it to </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Whether it was safe to give </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> falsificaso―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">After all, those documents were written before I was born. Could we trust something that old? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Because of that worry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> apparently used the falsificaso on </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">herself</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, without telling anyone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Her own</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> constitution―by changing it, she cured </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"If I remember right, there was a plan to test in Megasawa City whether falsificaso was harmful, wasn't there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, I heard about that from </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But in the end the Droga was never used, so I didn't hold </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to account. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But it seems </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had been listening to </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> heard only the part about being found out by me, and jumped from the cliff."</STYLE><PG>
I had heard about that part.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that changing <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san's</STYLE> constitution was what cured <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> madness―that was news to me.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
Huh?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wait a minute...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That... 
{PAUSE ""}
What does that mean?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It can't be... 
{PAUSE ""}
That person...!<PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\人をつかむ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, please tell me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I grabbed <STYLE ID="1">Obaasan</STYLE> by both shoulders and shook her as I pressed her.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Why does </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> still have odd eyes!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Once </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> has her first period, they'll try to kill each other, won't they!? Why isn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> being treated!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was what had felt off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, maybe I noticed it at the very start, but it had long been buried somewhere far back in my memory.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That was </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> decision. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> apparently means to give </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> falsificaso once </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kana's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> first period starts, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"But that's so inefficient!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　I mean, worst case, if </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> came face to face between her first period and the dose, they'd kill each other...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's why </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> sent </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to Tokyo. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That way, they only see each other a few days a year."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Were there any side effects from using falsificaso on </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"As far as I know, there was nothing of the sort, but..."</STYLE><PG>
The safety of falsificaso must already have been established.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so, just sending <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> to Tokyo without curing her is far too roundabout a way to go about it!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Waiting for <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan's</STYLE> first period, going out of the way to send <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> to Tokyo...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the point were to use <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> precognition right up to the limit, I'd understand, but sending her off to Tokyo defeats the whole purpose.<PG>
No... the people of the settlement don't know about <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> precognition, do they...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But at least <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE>, who read the books in the storehouse, must have realized.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or is it because the residents would fear it as 'the witch's power'?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then the timing is strange too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ死体.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "400" "C" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱子供.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The first curse-killing happened a year after <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE> died, and by the time <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE> died, <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> already had precognition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For at least a year after <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE> died, there was no reason to shun precognition as 'the witch's power.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So it's clearly strange that <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> wasn't given falsificaso during that year.<PG>
Even if <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> hadn't told anyone about her own precognition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> must have known that <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> had precognition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> is deliberately leaving <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> green-eyed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though that is extremely dangerous...!<PG>
Which means...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The suspicious one isn't <STYLE ID="1">Obaasan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
It's <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE>! <STYLE ID="3">That man</STYLE> is hiding something!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\荒田枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, I understand your doubts, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Erina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But what </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> feared most was whether the residents would get suspicious of </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> eye color."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What do you mean?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hardly anyone knows about the green-eye curse-killing, but you can't say no one does. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It's an old legend, after all. Wouldn't be strange if someone had heard it from their grandparents, would it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"But then, wouldn't people have gotten suspicious when </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> was born...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Nothing like that happened back then. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe since it's such an old legend, even those who knew didn't care... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But eye color isn't something that just changes. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If that drew suspicion, then how would </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> be looked at next?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Honestly, I'm not </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ふ">convinced</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">If there was falsificaso, I think you could have explained that there was a proper treatment..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"It'd be nice if things went that smoothly... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But if it failed..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"............"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地入口.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Here, we've arrived."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Between the withered trees, a cave gaping wide―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
According to <STYLE ID="1">Obaasan</STYLE>, it is a hole made by the movements of <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.<PG>
Before I press her about <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE>, let me look around in here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I hurl my suspicion of <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> at her openly, she may well cover for him, since they're mother and son.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I want a little more to go on.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地穴.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Erina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, sorry, but could you shine the light down from up here?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I'll go down first."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Oh, yes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ハシゴ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
But before I could shine the light, <STYLE ID="1">Obaasan</STYLE> had already climbed down the ladder.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
Has she simply gotten used to this ladder by now?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ハシゴ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
After a smooth patter of footsteps, a light blinked on down below.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Come on down. Slowly, now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
