<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Looks that way. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But this cave was made by the monster that makes the Fierce Sound―the monster they call </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, or </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Abaddon</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
