<STYLE ID="1">This cave and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> must surely be </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="つな">connected</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> is a fungus, so a hollow like this forms wherever its hyphae have been.
