<BR>
It is a creature of unimaginable size, so its hyphae could be outlandishly large too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But where in this apparent dead end is there a way through to <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>?<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, once we get to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, what are we supposed to do?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　We still have no countermeasure..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Do you remember the lore from before? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">'The dead come forth from the underworld, and uncanny bewitching flowers rise in rows. Those who have become corpses also become bewitching flowers and come forth from the underworld.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">―That lore has a continuation."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Only the green-eyed prevail. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Those who have become green-eyed wither the bewitching flowers and return the dead to the underworld. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The descendants shall without fail don masks and blood-red garb, and resist."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="14">Green eyes...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means―someone with green eyes can subdue <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So that's why she's sending <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> to <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> eyes, as I saw just now...<PG>
