<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, please, bring </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> from the abandoned hut. </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> should still have green eyes. </STYLE>
