<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ指さしバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Don't you worry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Erina-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. Old as I am, I'm more than a match for any man around here!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
With those parting words, <STYLE ID="1">Erika-chan</STYLE> was gone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't know how much of a threat the corpses are, but <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> must have seen it firsthand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Will <STYLE ID="1">Erika-chan</STYLE> really be all right on her own?<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, the corpses―what are they like?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... The ones I met were no different from ordinary people, at the very least. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">They wear white robes, and their speech and gestures are just like the real person's, but their will belongs entirely to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And above all, they have terrifying physical strength. Far more than someone like me could ever stand up to."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Ugh... I thought they'd be something like zombies, but it's the exact opposite... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">―will she be all right on her own...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Honestly... it'll be tough..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Then―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... we have no other means left. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">With the strength I have now, I'd be no use at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Besides... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'ve noticed too, haven't you? About </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... I hate to say it, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> is hiding something."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, it seemed, had been thinking the same thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had suspected <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="1">Erika-chan</STYLE>, but <STYLE ID="1">Erika-chan's</STYLE> knowledge was simply skewed in amount and direction.<PG>
But <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE>, while knowing all that, has kept it hidden the whole time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no doubt he's hiding something.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... I think </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱横顔血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Oh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> glanced toward the wall.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\空洞\空洞.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A large stone had been placed against the wall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Beside it, a hole just a little smaller than the stone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looked as if the stone had been blocking the hole until recently.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There seemed to be something inside the hole.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... There's something in there. I'll pull it out."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Be careful, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> thrust her hand into the hole and dragged out whatever was in there.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Ugh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With a small cry, I covered my mouth with my sleeve without thinking.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\z50逆.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "$000080" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\ミイラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
A mummy, a Noh mask over its face, dressed in tattered red robes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could this be...<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... So this is... Verde's mummy..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> kneels and puts her hands together.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... She is one of the settlement's ancestors, after all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I <STYLE ID="17" RUBY="なら">follow</STYLE> suit and put my hands together.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was Tomi, the 14-year-old girl who, driven by an unbearable murderous intent because of her green eyes, took her own life.<PG>
I can't even imagine what she felt as she took her own life.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> is one of the rare few who have felt that murderous intent too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> must understand only too well what Tomi felt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This Tomi, too, must still be waiting for the moment she is freed from <STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>'s rule.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But we can't afford to linger like this for long.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\空洞\空洞.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱うつむき血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, let's go. There must be a passage leading to Mount Itohime further in, don't you think?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　And... what on earth is </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> hiding...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could feel a faint breeze from the hole the mummy had been in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The hole seemed to be deeper than it looked.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> stayed perfectly still, hands together, eyes closed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Isn't that a bit long for a prayer at a time like this?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱横顔血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">―I'll tell you about him later. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Right now, we have to hurry. Come with me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Me, come along too...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just before, she had been telling me to <STYLE ID="4">"go back to the house"</STYLE>...<PG>
Is <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> uneasy too, with her strength worn down?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or did <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> decide I'd be safer with her than alone in the settlement?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oh well. I've come this far.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="16">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, I'm going on ahead.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
